---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party content that ships inside this repository
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Press Start 2P
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, with the licence text beside the font. Bundled
  deliberately: a desktop application may not reach the network to draw its own
  first frame.

Rust and npm dependencies
  Listed in Cargo.lock and package-lock.json. Every one is permissive by
  policy: BUILD/deny.toml names the licences that may enter the tree, and
  continuous integration fails the build if another one does.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Programs Epoch can install for you, and does not distribute
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Epoch fetches these from their own publishers, the way you would have, if you
ask it to. None is bundled here and none is redistributed by this project. Each
keeps its own licence, which Epoch shows on the row before you press anything.

  Piper            GPL-3.0             text to speech
  whisper.cpp      MIT                 speech to text
  Piper voices     MIT (rhasspy)       the voices Piper reads
  ONNX Runtime     MIT                 runs a converted voice
  PyTorch (CPU)    BSD-3-Clause        converts a voice, once
  Ollama           MIT                 runs models locally
  llama.cpp        MIT                 runs models locally
  LM Studio        proprietary, free   runs models locally
  ComfyUI          GPL-3.0             draws pictures, video, sound and 3D
  Claude Code      proprietary         Anthropic's coding agent
  Codex            Apache-2.0          OpenAI's coding agent
  Gemini CLI       Apache-2.0          Google's agent

